    "%lld칸이 필요해요. 지금은 %lld칸이에요" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Needs %1$lld cells, this has %2$lld"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lldマス必要です。今は%2$lldマスです"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要 %1$lld 格,现在是 %2$lld 格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld행 %lld열" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Row %1$lld, column %2$lld"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld行 %2$lld列"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第%1$lld行 第%2$lld列"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Pencil Pro를 쥐거나 Apple Pencil 2세대를 두 번 탭하면 메모 모드가 켜지고 꺼져요." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Squeeze Apple Pencil Pro or double-tap Apple Pencil (2nd generation) to turn note mode on or off."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Pencil Proを握るか、Apple Pencil（第2世代）をダブルタップすると、メモモードが切り替わります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "捏一下 Apple Pencil Pro 或双击 Apple Pencil（第二代）可开关笔记模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Pencil Pro를 쥐거나 Apple Pencil 2세대를 두 번 탭하면 열기와 깃발 모드가 바뀌어요." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Squeeze Apple Pencil Pro or double-tap Apple Pencil (2nd generation) to switch between Open and Flag."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Pencil Proを握るか、Apple Pencil（第2世代）をダブルタップすると、開くモードと旗モードが切り替わります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "捏一下 Apple Pencil Pro 或双击 Apple Pencil（第二代）可在翻开和插旗模式之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Pencil Pro를 쥐거나 Apple Pencil 2세대를 두 번 탭하면 지우개 모드가 켜지고 꺼져요." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Squeeze Apple Pencil Pro or double-tap Apple Pencil (2nd generation) to turn eraser mode on or off."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Pencil Proを握るか、Apple Pencil（第2世代）をダブルタップすると、消しゴムモードが切り替わります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "捏一下 Apple Pencil Pro 或双击 Apple Pencil（第二代）可开关橡皮擦模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPad 보드" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPad boards"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPad 用ボード"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPad 棋盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPad에서는 Apple Pencil로 칸을 선택하고 숫자를 입력할 수 있어요." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On iPad, you can select squares and enter numbers with Apple Pencil."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPadではApple Pencilでマスを選び、数字を入力できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iPad 上可以用 Apple Pencil 选择格子并输入数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 보드" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
